# Environment Variables — WeddingOS

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values.

## Required

```env
# --- Database (use two vars — never a single DATABASE_URL) ---
APP_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname_production
APP_DATABASE_DEVELOPMENT=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname_dev

# --- Auth ---
SESSION_SECRET=change-me-to-a-random-64-char-string
```

## Optional (feature degrades gracefully when unset)

```env
# --- OpenRouter (in-app AI features) ---
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# --- Agent Mail (2FA / inbox provisioning) ---
# AGENTMAIL_API_KEY=

# --- Replit (if applicable) ---
# REPLIT_ID=
# PORT=5000

# --- Payments ---
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# --- Email ---
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# ADMIN_EMAIL=

# --- Error Tracking ---
# SENTRY_DSN=
```

> **Rule:** Every optional feature must be a no-op when its env var is unset. Never crash because of a missing optional var.